Description: System Administration & Control Center for AlphaOS
 Beta Assistant is a native, modern graphical administration and control center
 crafted specifically for AlphaOS. It provides an intuitive GUI interface for
 package management, repository updates, user accounts and system daemons,
 systemd services, UFW network firewall, disk storage cleaning, and boot diagnostics.
